From b7ae0a754d73522e4ed97f880a10ab10a2ea5ecd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 05:47:24 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] chronik: native mempool indexes (history, UTXOs, spent-by)

Port chronik-db mem/{data,group_history,group_utxos,spent_by,mempool}.rs
without plugins. Mempool keeps Rust's insertion order (script history,
script UTXOs, spent-by, tokens, LOKAD id, then the duplicate check) and
error texts. Token indexing plugs in through MempoolTokenHook; enabling
the token index without a hook fails closed.

Tests: 8 cases (Rust has 3 for these modules).

Tier: eCash
